{
  "name": "lame-axisymmetric",
  "reference": "Benchmark C2. Lame thick cylinder, a = 0.1 m, b = 0.2 m, internal pressure p = 60 MPa, E = 200 GPa, nu = 0.3. A = p a^2/(b^2 - a^2) = 20 MPa, B = p a^2 b^2/(b^2 - a^2) = 8e5 Pa m^2; sigma_r = A - B/r^2, sigma_theta = A + B/r^2, so sigma_theta(a) = 100 MPa and sigma_rr(a) = -60 MPa whatever the idealisation. The displacement is not idealisation-free: with eps_z = 0 (plane strain, and an axisymmetric or 3D ring held at both ends) u_r(a) = (1+nu)/E (A(1-2nu)a + B/a) = 5.72e-5 m, while free ends (sigma_z = 0) give 5.90e-5 m, which is BENCHMARKS.md's SimScale number. Every row here holds eps_z = 0. This row is the (r, z) strip r in [0.1, 0.2] m, z in [0, 0.1] m as 8 by 8 quad8 under the axisymmetric idealisation, with u_z = 0 on both z edges so eps_z = 0 and the plane-strain closed form applies unchanged. Measured: sigma_theta(a) = 99.5883 MPa (0.41 %), sigma_rr(a) = -59.4205 MPa (0.97 %), u_r(a) = 5.719976e-5 m (0.0004 %).",
  "journal": [
    {
      "cmd": "model.new",
      "name": "lame-axisymmetric"
    },
    {
      "cmd": "model.setUnits",
      "units": {
        "length": "m",
        "stress": "MPa",
        "force": "N"
      }
    },
    {
      "cmd": "model.setIdealisation",
      "idealisation": {
        "kind": "axisymmetric"
      }
    },
    {
      "cmd": "material.add",
      "name": "steel",
      "E": "200 GPa",
      "nu": 0.3
    },
    {
      "cmd": "mesh.set",
      "mesher": {
        "kind": "mapped",
        "body": "tube",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "corners": [
              [
                "0.1 m",
                "0 m"
              ],
              [
                "0.2 m",
                "0 m"
              ],
              [
                "0.2 m",
                "0.1 m"
              ],
              [
                "0.1 m",
                "0.1 m"
              ]
            ],
            "n": [
              8,
              8
            ],
            "tags": [
              "zmin",
              "outer",
              "zmax",
              "inner"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "cmd": "material.assign",
      "material": "steel",
      "bodies": [
        "tube"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cmd": "constraint.symmetry",
      "name": "zmin",
      "on": "tube.zmin",
      "normal": "y"
    },
    {
      "cmd": "constraint.symmetry",
      "name": "zmax",
      "on": "tube.zmax",
      "normal": "y"
    },
    {
      "cmd": "load.pressure",
      "name": "inside",
      "on": "tube.inner",
      "value": "60 MPa"
    },
    {
      "cmd": "step.add",
      "name": "static",
      "procedure": "static",
      "constraints": [
        "zmin",
        "zmax"
      ],
      "loads": [
        "inside"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cmd": "solve.run",
      "step": "static"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "query": {
        "query": "query.probe",
        "field": "stress",
        "component": 2,
        "at": [
          "0.1 m",
          "0.05 m",
          "0 m"
        ]
      },
      "path": "/value/value",
      "expect": 100,
      "tol": 0.02,
      "rel": true,
      "note": "sigma_theta(a): Voigt 33 is the hoop under axisymmetry"
    },
    {
      "query": {
        "query": "query.probe",
        "field": "stress",
        "component": 0,
        "at": [
          "0.1 m",
          "0.05 m",
          "0 m"
        ]
      },
      "path": "/value/value",
      "expect": -60,
      "tol": 0.02,
      "rel": true,
      "note": "sigma_rr(a) = -p"
    },
    {
      "query": {
        "query": "query.probe",
        "field": "displacement",
        "component": 0,
        "at": [
          "0.1 m",
          "0.05 m",
          "0 m"
        ]
      },
      "path": "/value/value",
      "expect": 0.0000572,
      "tol": 0.01,
      "rel": true,
      "note": "u_r(a) with eps_z = 0"
    },
    {
      "query": {
        "query": "query.result"
      },
      "path": "/stale",
      "expect": false
    }
  ]
}
